<h1 class="page-header-title wpex-block wpex-m-0 wpex-text-5xl">
<span>JOSE LUIS ROLDAN ORTEGA</span>
</h1>
</div></div>
</PageHeader>
<div class="container wpex-clr" id="content-wrap">
<div class="content-area wpex-clr" id="primary">
<div class="site-content wpex-clr" id="content">
<div class="wpex-first-mt-0 wpex-clr" id="single-blocks">
<article class="single-content wpex-mt-20 entry wpex-clr" id="staff-single-content"><div class="wpb-content-wrapper"><div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6 wpex-vc_col-has-fill vc_general vc_parallax vc_parallax-content-moving" data-vc-parallax="1.5"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"><style is:inline> style="height:15px;"</style><div class="vcex-spacing wpex-w-100 wpex-clear" style="height:15px;"></div><figure class="vcex-image vcex-module"><div class="vcex-image-inner wpex-relative wpex-inline-block"><img alt="" class="vcex-image-img wpex-align-middle" decoding="async" height="613" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 613px) 100vw, 613px" src="/assets/uploads/2021/10/fot-joseluis.png" srcset="/assets/uploads/2021/10/fot-joseluis.png 613w, /assets/uploads/2021/10/fot-joseluis-300x300.png 300w, /assets/uploads/2021/10/fot-joseluis-150x150.png 150w" width="613" /></div></figure><style is:inline> style="height:15px;"</style><div class="vcex-spacing wpex-w-100 wpex-clear" style="height:15px;"></div><div class="vc_tta-container" data-vc-action="collapseAll"><div class="vc_general vc_tta vc_tta-accordion vc_tta-color-grey vc_tta-style-flat vc_tta-shape-rounded vc_tta-o-shape-group vc_tta-controls-align-default vc_tta-o-no-fill vc_tta-o-all-clickable"><div class="vc_tta-panels-container"><div class="vc_tta-panels"><AccordionPanel attributes={{"class": "vc_tta-panel", "data-vc-content": ".vc_tta-panel-body", "id": "1537216727694-e76220dd-094c1704323251174"}} bodyAttributes={{"class": "vc_tta-panel-body"}}><Fragment slot="heading"><div class="vc_tta-panel-heading"><h4 class="vc_tta-panel-title vc_tta-controls-icon-position-left"><a data-vc-accordion="" data-vc-container=".vc_tta-container" href="#1537216727694-e76220dd-094c1704323251174"><span class="vc_tta-title-text">Experience</span><i class="vc_tta-controls-icon vc_tta-controls-icon-plus"></i></a></h4></div></Fragment>
<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element">
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<p style="text-align: justify;">Law Degree (LLB) from the Instituto Tecnológico y de Estudios Superiores de Monterrey (ITESM), Campus Santa Fe (2013), where he participated in the Commercial Arbitration Program at the International Chamber of Commerce in Paris, France the Permanent Court of Arbitration in The Hague, Netherlands and the University of Vienna, Austria, Certified in Corporate Law (2015) and Master´s Degree in Laws (LLM) (2017) by Universidad La Salle Ciudad de México, and other postgraduate studies at the Jenkins Graduate School of the Universidad de las Américas Puebla and Universidad Iberoamericana, in Mexico City.</p>
<p style="text-align: justify;">Practitioner with more than 10 years of experience in civil, commercial, and constitutional litigation. He focusses on complex cases involving shareholder disputes, real estate projects, enforcement of securities and judgments issued abroad, international procedural collaboration, enforcement of arbitration awards and estate planning and litigation.</p>
<p style="text-align: justify;">For almost 10 years, he practiced as an Associate Attorney in the Civil and Commercial Litigation Area of Acedo Santamarina, S.C. a law firm in Mexico City where he focused on litigation with international aspects for foreign and transnational clients, including shareholders disputes, drafting and enforcement of international and sales of goods, technology, and telecommunications contracts, as well as the enforcement of international arbitration awards.</p>
<p style="text-align: justify;">Professor of the following courses: Commercial Procedural Law, Civil Procedural Law, Alternative Means of Dispute Resolution, Commercial Contracts, Legal Framework of Business and Commercial Companies at the School of Government and Social Sciences of the Instituto Tecnológico y de Estudios Superiores de Monterrey (ITESM) at Campus Santa Fe, Campus Estado de México and Campus Aguascalientes.</p>
</div>
</div>
</AccordionPanel><AccordionPanel attributes={{"class": "vc_tta-panel", "data-vc-content": ".vc_tta-panel-body", "id": "1537819874723-ba5d969a-5a801704323251174"}} bodyAttributes={{"class": "vc_tta-panel-body"}}><Fragment slot="heading"><div class="vc_tta-panel-heading"><h4 class="vc_tta-panel-title vc_tta-controls-icon-position-left"><a data-vc-accordion="" data-vc-container=".vc_tta-container" href="#1537819874723-ba5d969a-5a801704323251174"><span class="vc_tta-title-text">Languages</span><i class="vc_tta-controls-icon vc_tta-controls-icon-plus"></i></a></h4></div></Fragment>
<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element">
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<p>Spanish and English.</p>
</div>
</div>
</AccordionPanel></div></div></div></div><div class="vcex-module vcex-divider vcex-divider-solid vcex-divider-center wpex-mx-auto wpex-block wpex-h-0 wpex-border-b wpex-border-solid wpex-border-main" style="border-color:#ca0043;"></div><style is:inline> style="height:15px;"</style><div class="vcex-spacing wpex-w-100 wpex-clear" style="height:15px;"></div></div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"><style is:inline> style="height:150px;"</style><div class="vcex-spacing wpex-w-100 wpex-clear" style="height:150px;"></div>
<div class="wpb_text_column has-custom-color wpex-child-inherit-color wpb_content_element" style="color:#c3004f;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:var(--wpex-tracking-widest);text-transform:uppercase;">
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<p style="text-align: center;"><strong>PARTNER</strong></p>
</div>
</div>
<style is:inline> style="height:15px;"</style><div class="vcex-spacing wpex-w-100 wpex-clear" style="height:15px;"></div>
<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element">
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="mailto:jose.roldan@camya.mx">jose.roldan@camya.mx</a></p>
<p style="text-align: center;">At CAMYA, our team is composed of passionate and specialized lawyers. With exceptional academic background and diverse experience, we take pride in offering innovative legal solutions. We are committed to being your trusted partner, providing quality services that go beyond the conventional.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vcex-spacing wpex-w-100 wpex-clear"></div></div></div></div></div>
</div></article>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</main>
</SiteLayout>
